rooms_desc ({"You are travelling through a strange and enchanted forest.  Many leavescrunch beneath your feet, creating a strange and eerie echoing through theforest around you.  Far in the distance, you can hear animals moving about.There is a path leading north here through the forest.","You are still in a strange and enchanted forest.  The forest seems to getthicker to the north.  You can hear the noises of wild life all around you.There is a path leading north and south here through the forest.","The forest is thick and dark here.  You can barely see in front of you.You are not sure but there seems to be a cave to the north of here.  There isa path leading south here through the forest.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a bra